{"id": "34194", "title": "骗身诡计(再见王朝5)", "author": "白双", "category": "文学名著", "count": 40, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34194/34194s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34194.htm", "intro": "丰采迷人的影坛红星狠狠踢上大铁板!这个说话前后不搭轧的女人居然不认识他!? 前一秒才跟她介绍姓名，下一秒就睁着茫然大眼问他是谁?这样侮辱他的藐视行为岂能用“记性不好”带过?事情肯定另有蹊跷……什么!!她是世上唯一能解天才杀手“枭王”谜题的高手?为了避免枭王追杀，她的记忆密码被上了锁，变成今日健忘到“人神共愤”的笨模样……有趣!他兴致勃勃地自愿当起“解码器”，从同游香港、同居一室到同床共枕，他发觉愈来愈难控制自己翻腾的情潮，偏偏内忧加上外患——连子弹都飞来凑一脚，莫非是英才惜英才，枭王对她萌生爱意? 哼!他没看过坏人也看过警察捉强盗，想跟他抢女人?门儿都没有……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34194", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2172732.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2172733.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2172734.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2172735.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2172736.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2172737.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2172738.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2172739.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2172740.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2172741.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2172742.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2172743.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2172744.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2172745.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2172746.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2172747.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2172748.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2172749.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2172750.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2172751.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2172752.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2172753.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2172754.html", "available": fa